    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Sophisticated Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Sophisticated Dark\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-full w-full bg-[#1C1B1F] text-[#E6E1E5] font-sans overflow-hidden\\\"><header class=\\\"p-6 flex justify-between items-center\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\"><span class=\\\"text-[#CAC4D0] text-xs font-medium tracking-wider uppercase\\\">Monthly Overview</span><h1 class=\\\"text-2xl font-semibold text-[#E6E1E5]\\\">October 2023</h1></div><div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\"><button class=\\\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#49454F] flex items-center justify-center active:scale-95 transition-transform\\\"><div class=\\\"w-5 h-5 border-2 border-[#D0BCFF] rounded-sm relative\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-1 bg-[#D0BCFF] opacity-30\\\"></div></div></button><button class=\\\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#D0BCFF] flex items-center justify-center active:scale-95 transition-transform\\\"><div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full border-2 border-[#1C1B1F]\\\"></div></button></div></header><div class=\\\"flex-1 px-6 flex flex-col gap-6 overflow-hidden\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-[#2B2930] rounded-[28px] p-6 shadow-xl border border-[#49454F]/30\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-start mb-4\\\"><div><p class=\\\"text-[#CAC4D0] text-sm\\\">Total Savings</p><h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-[#D0BCFF]\\\">$4,280.50</h2></div><div class=\\\"bg-[#381E72] px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[#D0BCFF] text-xs font-bold\\\">+12.5%</div></div><div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-[#49454F] pt-4\\\"><div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\"><span class=\\\"text-[#938F99] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Budget</span><span class=\\\"text-lg font-medium\\\">$6,500.00</span></div><div class=\\\"flex flex-col items-end\\\"><span class=\\\"text-[#938F99] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Spent</span><span class=\\\"text-lg font-medium text-[#F2B8B5]\\\">$2,219.50</span></div></div></div><div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-4 flex-1\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\"><h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-medium\\\">Budget vs Savings</h3><span class=\\\"text-[#D0BCFF] text-sm font-medium uppercase\\\">Yearly view</span></div><div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#2B2930] rounded-[28px] p-6 flex items-end justify-between gap-2 border border-[#49454F]/30\\\"><div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full flex items-end justify-center gap-1 h-32\\\"><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#49454F] rounded-t-sm h-[60%]\\\"></div><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#D0BCFF] rounded-t-sm h-[80%]\\\"></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#938F99]\\\">Aug</span></div><div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full flex items-end justify-center gap-1 h-32\\\"><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#49454F] rounded-t-sm h-[75%]\\\"></div><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#D0BCFF] rounded-t-sm h-[65%]\\\"></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#938F99]\\\">Sep</span></div><div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full flex items-end justify-center gap-1 h-32\\\"><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#49454F] rounded-t-sm h-[40%]\\\"></div><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#D0BCFF] rounded-t-sm h-[95%]\\\"></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#E6E1E5] font-bold\\\">Oct</span></div><div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full flex items-end justify-center gap-1 h-32\\\"><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#49454F] rounded-t-sm h-[85%]\\\"></div><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#D0BCFF] rounded-t-sm h-[45%]\\\"></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#938F99]\\\">Nov</span></div><div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full flex items-end justify-center gap-1 h-32\\\"><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#49454F] rounded-t-sm h-[55%]\\\"></div><div class=\\\"w-3 bg-[#D0BCFF] rounded-t-sm h-[70%]\\\"></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#938F99]\\\">Dec</span></div></div></div><div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-6\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#2B2930]/50 rounded-2xl border border-[#49454F]/20\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\"><div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#381E72] flex items-center justify-center text-xl\\\">\360\237\217\240</div><div><p class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Rent & Housing</p><p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#938F99]\\\">Oct 01, 2023</p></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[#F2B8B5] font-semibold\\\">-$1,200.00</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#2B2930]/50 rounded-2xl border border-[#49454F]/20\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\"><div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#4F378B] flex items-center justify-center text-xl\\\">\342\230\225</div><div><p class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Lifestyle</p><p class=\\\"text-xs text-[#938F99]\\\">Oct 12, 2023</p></div></div><span class=\\\"text-[#F2B8B5] font-semibold\\\">-$34.20</span></div></div></div><nav class=\\\"h-20 bg-[#211F26] border-t border-[#49454F] flex items-center justify-around px-2\\\"><button class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-[#D0BCFF]\\\"><div class=\\\"w-16 h-8 bg-[#381E72] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-1\\\"><span class=\\\"text-xl\\\">\360\237\223\212</span></div><span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">Home</span></button><button class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-[#CAC4D0]\\\"><span class=\\\"text-xl\\\">\360\237\223\205</span><span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">Yearly</span></button><button class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-[#CAC4D0]\\\"><span class=\\\"text-xl\\\">\360\237\224\220</span><span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">Vault</span></button><button class=\\\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-[#CAC4D0]\\\"><span class=\\\"text-xl\\\">\360\237\221\244</span><span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">Profile</span></button></nav></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
